              </?01M1C3T6GYY1XNC59VFH0G4Y0A>
              <Criterion #P1-T2-AC2 { checked = true } ?01M1C3T6GYY1XNC59VFH0G4Y0B>
              legacy ResourceVfs 被明确标记为单 revision 的只读 projection。
              </?01M1C3T6GYY1XNC59VFH0G4Y0B>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P2 { name = "Prove and hand off authority baseline" status = "DONE" priority = "P0" order = 1 } (
        <Description ?01M1C3T6GYY1XNC59VFH0G4Y0C>
        用契约测试和系统级 RED inventory 为后续 owner Track 建立可验证边界。
